/**
Connector TDBU Child Driver - Easy Dashboard Compatible
For: TDBU Blinds (9) - Top-Down/Bottom-Up
Commands: TDBU-specific (top/bottom positions)

Release v30 04-08-2026 - Hubitat logic only (100=Open, 0=Closed), Parent handles inversion, Interpolation stability fixes

DD7002B & DD7006 Compatible - Fixed type coercion issues
NOTE: Parent driver handles position inversion (Bridge ↔ Hubitat). Child uses Hubitat logic only.
*/

